# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Defacement Monitor — Sender Email Configuration
# Copy this file to ".env" and fill in your details.
# The UI then only needs a recipient email — no other setup required.
# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# Email address used to SEND alerts (your Gmail / Outlook / Yahoo account)
SMTP_USER=your-email@gmail.com

# Password for the sender account.
#
#   Gmail users  →  https://myaccount.google.com/apppasswords
#                   (Enable 2-Step Verification first, then generate a 16-char
#                    "App Password" for "Mail". Paste it here — no prompts ever.)
#
#   Outlook/Hotmail → your regular Outlook password works here.
#   Yahoo           → generate at https://login.yahoo.com/myaccount/security/app-passwords/
#
SMTP_PASS=your-password-or-app-password

# Optional — auto-detected from your email domain if left blank.
# SMTP_HOST=smtp.gmail.com
# SMTP_PORT=587
